  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add the water to a medium saucepan and bring to <br>the boil.<br>• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce <br>heat to low.<br>• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat <br>and keep covered until rice is tender and water is <br>absorbed, 10 minutes.<br>• Add the plant-based butter and stir to combine. <br>Season to taste with salt and pepper. <br>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so  <br>don’t peek!  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-31094200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, trim and roughly chop pea pods. <br>• Thinly slice capsicum into strips. <br>• Roughly chop Asian greens. <br>• Thinly slice spring onion. <br>• Cut Japanese tofu into quarters.<br>• In a small bowl, combine plant-based Asian <br>mushroom sauce, the brown sugar, vinegar, soy <br>sauce and a splash of water.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-6148c610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat. Cook capsicum and pea pods, <br>until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-bd7e8920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with <br>a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing, until <br>browned, 3-4 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-135ae230.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Reduce heat to low. To the pan with tofu, add the <br>sauce mixture and return the veggies to the pan.<br>• Add Asian greens and toss until wilted and <br>combined, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-e70ea240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rice and Japanese tofu and pea pod stir-fry <br>between bowls.<br>• Top stir-fry with spring onion and sesame seeds <br>to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a44cc0866926770e8cd2cde/step-aabde050.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
